  "composition_summary": "Preserved the volatile tail unchanged (single user request, no justified repair). Authored one class-22 pure-logic draft pc-contrast-03: it reads raw slots via inputs.get('slots') so absence is a valid invalid-result, validates that the list has length 1..2 and every item is an exact integer in 3..7 (rejecting bool, float, non-integer and out-of-range), and returns {ok, slots: original if valid else []} with no I/O, imports, host calls, exceptions or upstream-validation assumption. The body assigns result on every branch and calls the helper, then assigns its return value. This is an unapproved target-interface draft only; activation requires Q1, human Q2 and typed-runner support, which are not claimed.",
